  "title": "Live Oak Bancshares, Inc. Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "WILMINGTON, N.C., July 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Live Oak Bancshares, Inc. (NYSE: LOB) (“Live Oak” or “the Company”) today reported second quarter of 2026 net income attributable to common shareholders of $34.7 million, or $0.74 per diluted common share. Live Oak’s performance in the quarter, compared to the first quarter of 2026 and second quarter of 2025, includes these notable items: Strong loan production of $1.55 billion accompanied by strong deposit growth of $712.5 million as of June 30",
